586
00:48:51.095 --> 00:48:54.457
I mean, just light-sensitive cells,
but we did it.

587
00:48:54.557 --> 00:48:56.883
Mutations are holding.

588
00:48:57.852 --> 00:48:59.427
You did it.

589
00:49:03.691 --> 00:49:06.636
That's the first step in
a really long process.

590
00:49:06.736 --> 00:49:11.147
It's gonna end as a worm in a box if
you don't get your ass back in the lab.

591
00:49:16.871 --> 00:49:18.655
Why don't you eat something?

592
